;; LOCAL Sweep-1 RE-SCREEN at concurrency 1 (the Sweep-1 corrections).
;;
;; Identical cells to local-sweep1-agentcfg.edn (2×2 prompt×budget × same 8 Q, N=1)
;; so it's directly A/B-comparable to the contaminated concurrency-2 run
;; (results/sweep-2026-06-05T20-00-09-448075Z). Two fixes under test together:
;;   1. concurrency 1 — removes the two-simultaneous-big-prefill GPU thrash that
;;      pushed 4/32 runs past the 600s cap (timeout-empties).
;;   2. finalize empty-recovery (graphs.clj) — the non-exhausted finalize path now
;;      recovers a blank :finalized? response via the guarded best-answer-now
;;      fallback, killing the ~28% complete-but-empty runs.
;; Expectation: empty-rate collapses vs the prior 25–62%; prompt/budget signal
;; becomes interpretable. If clean, follow up with an N=3 confirm on the winner.
;;
;; Run with the agent-run OPENAI_* env (preserve_thinking + recommended thinking
;; sampling). judge? false → judge separately via `bb sweep-judge`.
{:configs
 [{:id "default-prompt+default-budget"
   :skill-graph-id :builtin/agent-rag-graph-bundled
   :agent-prompt-variant :default
   :skill-params {}}
  {:id "adapted-prompt+default-budget"
   :skill-graph-id :builtin/agent-rag-graph-bundled
   :agent-prompt-variant :qwen-adapted
   :skill-params {}}
  {:id "default-prompt+reduced-budget"
   :skill-graph-id :builtin/agent-rag-graph-bundled
   :agent-prompt-variant :default
   :skill-params #:builtin{:rerank {:context-top-k 6 :max-context-length 5000}}}
